{"id":"2365a2a4d0a5e87e80f49a27db9579aa5e884c9e","axis":"silent","repo":"TYPO3/typo3","sha":"2365a2a4d0a5e87e80f49a27db9579aa5e884c9e","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Classes/DataHandling/DataHandler.php","lines":["@@ -7715,7 +7715,7 @@ public function hasPageContextPermission(string $table, int $perms, array|Virtua","         }","         $pagesSchema = $this->tcaSchemaFactory->get('pages');","         try {","-            if (!$pagesSchema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount) && !$this->BE_USER->isInWebMount($page, '', $useDeleteClause)) {","+            if (!$pagesSchema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction) && !$this->BE_USER->isInWebMount($page, '', $useDeleteClause)) {","                 return false;","             }","         } catch (InvalidPageRecordException) {"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Classes/Schema/Capability/TcaSchemaCapability.php","lines":["@@ -88,8 +88,19 @@ enum TcaSchemaCapability"," ","     case RestrictionRootLevel;"," ","-    // TCA[ctrl][ignoreWebMountRestriction] inverted","+    /**","+     * TCA[ctrl][security][ignoreWebMountRestriction]","+     *","+     * Despite its name, this is not an inversion of the TCA option, but the","+     * option itself. Use IgnoreWebMountRestriction instead.","+     *","+     * @deprecated since TYPO3 v15.0, will be removed in TYPO3 v16.0. Use TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction instead.","+     */","     case RestrictionWebMount;","+","+    // TCA[ctrl][security][ignoreWebMountRestriction]","+    case IgnoreWebMountRestriction;","+","     private const SYSTEM_CAPABILITIES = [","         self::CreatedAt,","         self::UpdatedAt,"],"additions":12,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Classes/Schema/TcaSchema.php","lines":["@@ -140,7 +140,7 @@ public function hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability $capability): bool","             // This is an implicit restriction with a custom configuration","             TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionRootLevel => true,","             TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount => !empty($this->schemaConfiguration['security']['ignoreWebMountRestriction'] ?? false),","-","+            TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction => !empty($this->schemaConfiguration['security']['ignoreWebMountRestriction'] ?? false),","             TcaSchemaCapability::ExtbaseHistoryTracking => (bool)($this->schemaConfiguration['extbase']['enableHistoryTracking'] ?? true),","         };","     }","@@ -194,6 +194,7 @@ public function getCapability(TcaSchemaCapability $capability): Capability\\Schem","             TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionUserGroup => new Capability\\FieldCapability($this->getField($this->schemaConfiguration['enablecolumns']['fe_group'])),","             TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionRootLevel => new Capability\\RootLevelCapability((int)($this->schemaConfiguration['rootLevel'] ?? 0), (bool)($this->schemaConfiguration['security']['ignoreRootLevelRestriction'] ?? false)),","             TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount => new Capability\\ScalarCapability((bool)($this->schemaConfiguration['security']['ignoreWebMountRestriction'] ?? false)),","+            TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction => new Capability\\ScalarCapability((bool)($this->schemaConfiguration['security']['ignoreWebMountRestriction'] ?? false)),"," ","             TcaSchemaCapability::ExtbaseHistoryTracking => new Capability\\ScalarCapability((bool)($this->schemaConfiguration['extbase']['enableHistoryTracking'] ?? true)),","         };"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Documentation/Changelog/15.0/Deprecation-110086-TcaSchemaCapabilityRestrictionWebMount.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,59 @@","+..  include:: /Includes.rst.txt","+","+..  _deprecation-110086-1794514228:","+","+===============================================================","+Deprecation: #110086 - TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount","+===============================================================","+","+See :issue:`110086`","+","+Description","+===========","+","+The enum case :php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Schema\\Capability\\TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount`","+has been marked as deprecated and will be removed in TYPO3 v16.0.","+","+Despite its name, the case never represented a restriction. It was meant to be","+the inversion of :php:`TCA[ctrl][security][ignoreWebMountRestriction]`, but it","+has always behaved exactly like that option: it is :php:`true` for tables that","+ignore the web mount restriction.","+","+The new enum case","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Schema\\Capability\\TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction`","+carries the same value and the name states what it means.","+","+Impact","+======","+","+Using :php:`TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount` continues to work and","+returns the same value as before. The case will be removed in TYPO3 v16.0.","+","+Affected installations","+======================","+","+TYPO3 installations with custom extensions or code that use","+:php:`TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount`, for example in calls to","+:php:`TcaSchema->hasCapability()` or :php:`TcaSchema->getCapability()`, are","+affected.","+","+The extension scanner will report any usage as a **strong match**.","+","+Migration","+=========","+","+Replace :php:`TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount` with","+:php:`TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction`. The returned value is","+identical, so no inversion of the surrounding condition is needed.","+","+..  code-block:: php","+    :caption: Before (deprecated)","+","+    $ignoreWebMountRestriction = $schema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount);","+","+..  code-block:: php","+    :caption: After (recommended)","+","+    $ignoreWebMountRestriction = $schema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction);","+","+..  index:: PHP-API, FullyScanned, ext:core"],"additions":59,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Tests/Functional/Schema/TcaSchemaTest.php","lines":["@@ -141,6 +141,29 @@ public function rootLevelCapabilityUsesProperConfiguration(): void","         self::assertTrue($rootLevelRestriction->canExistOnRootLevel());","     }"," ","+    #[Test]","+    public function ignoreWebMountRestrictionCapabilityReflectsTcaOption(): void","+    {","+        $factory = $this->get(TcaSchemaFactory::class);","+        $pagesSchema = $factory->get('pages');","+        self::assertFalse($pagesSchema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction));","+        $fileSchema = $factory->get('sys_file');","+        self::assertTrue($fileSchema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction));","+    }","+","+    #[Test]","+    public function deprecatedRestrictionWebMountCapabilityMatchesIgnoreWebMountRestriction(): void","+    {","+        $factory = $this->get(TcaSchemaFactory::class);","+        foreach (['pages', 'sys_file'] as $table) {","+            $schema = $factory->get($table);","+            self::assertSame(","+                $schema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::IgnoreWebMountRestriction),","+                $schema->hasCapability(TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount),","+            );","+        }","+    }","+","     #[Test]","     public function labelsAreAddedToSchema(): void","     {"],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/install/Configuration/ExtensionScanner/Php/ClassConstantMatcher.php","lines":["@@ -31,6 +31,11 @@","             'Breaking-82378-RemoveNamespacedJQuery.rst',","         ],","     ],","+    'TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Schema\\Capability\\TcaSchemaCapability::RestrictionWebMount' => [","+        'restFiles' => [","+            'Deprecation-110086-TcaSchemaCapabilityRestrictionWebMount.rst',","+        ],","+    ],","     'TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Utility\\GeneralUtility::SYSLOG_SEVERITY_INFO' => [","         'restFiles' => [","             'Deprecation-52694-DeprecatedGeneralUtilitydevLog.rst',",""],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":102,"deletions":3,"truncated":false,"file_count":6},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:04:54.912970+00:00"}